# What a desktop needs from its local network, opened to it alone.

# mDNS (Avahi): the names of the network (`think.local`), its printers,
# shares and screens to cast to.
add rule inet orbit lan_in udp dport 5353 accept comment "mDNS"

# Answers to discovery searches this machine sends by multicast, which each
# device sends back unicast, so they match no connection: SSDP (UPnP and
# DLNA servers, routers) and WS-Discovery (Windows shares in Orbit-Files).
add rule inet orbit lan_in udp sport 1900 accept comment "SSDP answers"
add rule inet orbit lan_in udp sport 3702 accept comment "WS-Discovery answers"
